GAPS: direct, primary-source proof of Putin’s personal assets or beneficial ownership in 2022 remains thin; the strongest next step is more Russian-language investigative and court-record work on hidden property, proxies, and family holdings. The other gap is direct 2022 evidence on Putin personally correcting false claims versus doubling down, and on appointment choices that show his own favoritism rather than just elite-network patronage. Best next query families: `Путин дворец 2022`, `Путин оффшоры 2022`, `Путин ложь Украина 2022`, `Ковальчук Ротенберг контракты 2022`, `ФБК Путин имущество`, `Прокуратура/суды Navalny 2022`, and Russian-language reporting from Proekt, Meduza, and Novaya Gazeta Europe.

